        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Insurance - The District will establish a cafeteria benefits plan with the District paying $479.00 toward the plan for the 2003-2004 school year. Employees who opt out of all applicable insurance coverages will receive $160.00 per month. The District Insurance Committee will review the various plan designs and make recommendations to the District and employee groups. The amount the District will contribute toward the insurance benefits programs will be agreed to annually as part of the compensation package during negotiations.",
